ok 6 '_get_content() --title' detects and returns org titles.
ok 7 '_get_content() --title' detects and returns LaTeX titles.
ok 8 '_get_content() --title' detects and returns AsciiDoc titles.
ok 9 '_get_content()' returns first line when no title.
ok 10 '_get_content()' returns first line after newlines.
ok 11 '_get_content()' returns first line after code block.
ok 12 '_get_content()' returns first line after code block and front matter.
ok 13 '_get_content()' returns first line after front matter.
ok 14 '_get_content()' returns nothing with only code block and front matter.
